This task adapts selected offline tomography mathematics from Daniele Hamm's
real-time-tomo-prad and pyxu-diffops projects, distributed under the MIT license.
The accompanying LICENSE preserves the original project license. Original
copyright attribution and exact revisions are recorded in test/validation.md.
Measured TCV data are author-distributed with the research repository; a separate
per-file measurement-data license is not identified. No independent physical
ground truth is provided. The realtime reduced-vessel implementation has an
identified gradient discrepancy and is not presented as a validated solver here.


